"Rocket Girl!" Mayor Bloom said.

5
00:00:15.691 --> 00:00:18.579
"Forget about looking for Black Spinneret in the subway.

6
00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:21.989
Get to the rooftop of the Grand Metro Tower, and hurry!

7
00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:24.562
She's robbing guests at a garden party.

8
00:00:24.563 --> 00:00:26.651
You have to stop her!"

9
00:00:26.652 --> 00:00:31.840
"I'm on my way, Mayor!" Roxy said.

10
00:00:31.841 --> 00:00:34.843
*** Terrell was walking back to the subway

